alue of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> is ______.&nbsp;(Nearest integer)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>626</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>34</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Js</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"}, "options": [{"id": "12e564", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f5f2ee0e063d9274723"}, {"id": "a289e0", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f5f2ee0e063d9274724"}, {"id": "8867c6", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f5f2ee0e063d9274725"}, {"id": "8857e7", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f5f2ee0e063d9274726"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f5f2ee0e063d9274727", "type": "numerical", "chapters": ["60c9e849ea076dc381c0dfb1"], "topics": ["60e2fada66f9ce3f243b478d"], "concepts": ["60e5671a499d1e49588f87f1"], "question": {"text": "The number of electrons present in all the completely filled subshells having <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math> is ____ (Where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo></math> principal quantum number and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>=</mo></math> spin quantum number)"}, "options": [{"id": "83f405", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f5f2ee0e063d9274728"}, {"id": "5760bc", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f5f2ee0e063d9274729"}, {"id": "60338e", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f5f2ee0e063d927472a"}, {"id": "47998c", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f5f2ee0e063d927472b"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f5f2ee0e063d92